From f33163d5266ab85c2f00934495d306a2d6766cdc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Patryk <patryk@Patryks-MacBook.local>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 11:34:58 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] build(admin): publish the dashboard at /admin/ on the futa0.5
 deploy

Owner approved the rollout, so the CI side is now wired: build the admin
dashboard (its own build, so no player downloads it) and hand the output to the
composer as its fourth argument.

With that argument absent the composed site is byte-identical to today's - the
composer's own test asserts that - so this is the one line that switches /admin/
on. Removing the argument switches it off again.

Caveat recorded in docs/ADMIN.md: each deploy recomposes the whole site, so
whichever branch pushes last decides whether /admin/ is present. While only
futa0.5-online carries this step, a futa0.4 push would drop it until the next
futa0.5-online deploy.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
---
 .github/workflows/futasaku04-preview.yml | 12 +++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/.github/workflows/futasaku04-preview.yml b/.github/workflows/futasaku04-preview.yml
index ad8f859..6e9c3be 100644
--- a/.github/workflows/futasaku04-preview.yml
+++ b/.github/workflows/futasaku04-preview.yml
@@ -92,6 +92,16 @@ jobs:
           npm run web:build
           node scripts/check-channel-assets.mjs
           echo "$(git rev-parse HEAD)" > web/dist/BUILD_SHA
+      # The admin dashboard (futasaku.com/admin/). Its own build, so no player ever downloads it.
+      # Published only because the compose step below is handed `web/dist-admin`; remove that
+      # argument and the composed site is byte-identical to what shipped before.
+      - name: Build the admin dashboard
+        working-directory: futa05
+        env:
+          VITE_DUEL_API_URL: ${{ vars.VITE_DUEL_API_URL || vars.FUTA05_API_URL }}
+        run: |
+          test -n "$VITE_DUEL_API_URL" || { echo "Missing Actions Variable VITE_DUEL_API_URL (may fall back to FUTA05_API_URL)"; exit 1; }
+          npm run admin:build
       - name: Rebuild current published versions at their exact SHAs
         run: |
           cd live
@@ -112,7 +122,7 @@ jobs:
           node candidate/scripts/compose-pages.mjs live/web/dist dev/web/dist candidate/web/dist site \
             "$MAIN_SHA" "$DEV_SHA" "$TEST2_SHA"
           node preview/scripts/compose-futasaku-preview.mjs site preview/web/dist "$(git -C preview rev-parse HEAD)" preview/web/dist-futa-test
-          node futa05/scripts/compose-futa05-preview.mjs site futa05/web/dist "$(git -C futa05 rev-parse HEAD)"
+          node futa05/scripts/compose-futa05-preview.mjs site futa05/web/dist "$(git -C futa05 rev-parse HEAD)" futa05/web/dist-admin
           node preview/scripts/check-pages-parity.mjs site
       - uses: actions/configure-pages@v5
       - uses: actions/upload-pages-artifact@v3
-- 
